        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we had 534 full-time team members, including 211 team members across sales, marketing, and customer success and 231 team members across product development and engineering.",
        "start_character": 35150,
        "end_character": 35347
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001891027-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001891027-26-000019-480f7e95af90b905",
        "accession_number": "0001891027-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "By tracking and measuring impressions at a granular level, we are able to provide advertisers with a detailed understanding of their campaign performance.",
        "start_character": 17381,
        "end_character": 17535
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001891027-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001891027-26-000019-480f7e95af90b905",
        "accession_number": "0001891027-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To ensure our culture is retained as we grow our workforce in an entirely remote environment, we have developed a strategy focused on fostering engagement among our team members and development that includes regular events and team-building initiatives, fireside chats with our leadership, multiple off-site meetings (which we refer to as MNTN Meets) a year, and monthly onboarding training sessions.",
        "start_character": 37166,
        "end_character": 37566
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001891027-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001891027-26-000019-480f7e95af90b905",
        "accession_number": "0001891027-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also use measures designed to control access to our technology and proprietary information.",
        "start_character": 44388,
        "end_character": 44482
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001891027-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001891027-26-000019-480f7e95af90b905",
        "accession_number": "0001891027-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe our culture enables us to attract, retain and develop exceptional talent, which is a critical component of our success, as evidenced by the long average tenure of our team members.",
        "start_character": 37713,
        "end_character": 37904
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001891027-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001891027-26-000019-480f7e95af90b905",
        "accession_number": "0001891027-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe our solutions offer our customers a comprehensive and accessible approach to developing TV ads and is particularly relevant for customers who have never developed TV advertising before.",
        "start_character": 14001,
        "end_character": 14197
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001891027-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001891027-26-000019-480f7e95af90b905",
        "accession_number": "0001891027-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continuously develop enhancements to existing features and add new capabilities, such as MNTN Matched, to deliver higher ROAS for our customers.",
        "start_character": 8365,
        "end_character": 8512
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001891027-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001891027-26-000019-480f7e95af90b905",
        "accession_number": "0001891027-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We facilitate this through regular one-on-one conversations among team members and senior management so that we are able to provide our team members with the support they need, and mandate compassion and honesty in all such conversations.",
        "start_character": 36232,
        "end_character": 36470
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001891027-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001891027-26-000019-480f7e95af90b905",
        "accession_number": "0001891027-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have further initiatives planned to continue to develop our retention strategy, such as engagement surveys, increased learning and development opportunities, and developing new best practices for how we hire, onboard and develop our teams.",
        "start_character": 38333,
        "end_character": 38575
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001891027-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001891027-26-000019-480f7e95af90b905",
        "accession_number": "0001891027-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We offer marketers a comprehensive and fully integrated software solution that combines targeting, measurement and attribution capabilities for performance marketing on CTV.",
        "start_character": 3743,
        "end_character": 3916
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001891027-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001891027-26-000019-480f7e95af90b905",
        "accession_number": "0001891027-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "•Automated Optimization: We have developed algorithms which automate and continuously optimize our targeting capabilities and programmatic ad execution (including automating creative and price optimization), as well as other campaign elements to drive better performance.",
        "start_character": 6605,
        "end_character": 6876
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001891027-26-000019",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001891027-26-000019-480f7e95af90b905",
        "accession_number": "0001891027-26-000019",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "•Reporting: In addition to standard performance marketing reports, we offer marketers analytics by brand, objective, audiences, campaign, keyword, creative, geography, and TV network, as well as a nearly unlimited number of custom reports using 479 million dimension and metric variations.",
        "start_character": 27933,
